      "updated": 1780139500000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\ud83d\udc49 STEP 3: Build the Image Layer-by-Layer\nCommand:\ndocker build -t my-python-app:v1 .\n\nAction: Docker reads Dockerfile, installs python,\ncompiles files, and saves a read-only frozen image.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\ud83d\udc49 STEP 3: Build the Image Layer-by-Layer\nCommand:\ndocker build -t my-python-app:v1 .\n\nAction: Docker reads Dockerfile, installs python,\ncompiles files, and saves a read-only frozen image.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
