      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\ud83d\udc0d python_app_service (Your Custom Code Container)\n- Runs: my-python-app:v1\n- Port: Published internally to the private virtual network.\n- Tasks: Queries PostgreSQL and caches outputs in Redis.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
