      "text": "\ud83d\udd34 cache_layer (Redis:alpine Cache Container)\n- Image: redis:alpine (Extremely small, 30MB Alpine Linux foot print)\n- Port: Maps 6379 on Host machine to 6379 in cache container\n- Tasks: High-speed temporary RAM database storage.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\ud83d\udd34 cache_layer (Redis:alpine Cache Container)\n- Image: redis:alpine (Extremely small, 30MB Alpine Linux foot print)\n- Port: Maps 6379 on Host machine to 6379 in cache container\n- Tasks: High-speed temporary RAM database storage.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
