      "text": "\ud83c\udf10 \ud83d\udd12 AUTOMATIC PRIVATE BRIDGE NETWORK\n- Docker Compose creates a private virtual network for these containers\n- Service names act as hostnames! Python App connects to Database via\n  host 'database_sandbox' and to Redis via host 'cache_layer'.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\ud83c\udf10 \ud83d\udd12 AUTOMATIC PRIVATE BRIDGE NETWORK\n- Docker Compose creates a private virtual network for these containers\n- Service names act as hostnames! Python App connects to Database via\n  host 'database_sandbox' and to Redis via host 'cache_layer'.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
