      "updated": 1780139500000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\ud83d\ude80 2. RUN & RUNTIME COMMANDS (Execution)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\ud83d\ude80 2. RUN & RUNTIME COMMANDS (Execution)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "GevrAq7DNAuQ0Z6u24J3a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -140,
      "y": 995,
      "width": 427.46,
      "height": 286.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1948711173,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1461620630,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1780139500000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "docker run -d --name name image:tag\n\ud83d\udc49 Runs a container in the background (detached mode).\n\ndocker run -p 8080:80 image:tag\n\ud83d\udc49 Runs container, mapping Host port 8080 to Container port 80.\n\ndocker run -v /host:/container image:tag\n\ud83d\udc49 Runs container, direct-mounting a host folder (bind mount).\n\ndocker run -e MY_VAR=val image:tag\n\ud83d\udc49 Injects environment variables dynamically inside container.\n\ndocker ps\n\ud83d\udc49 Lists all currently running containers.\n\ndocker ps -a\n\ud83d\udc49 Lists all containers (active, stopped, exited, crashed).\n\ndocker stop container_id   /   docker start container_id\n\ud83d\udc49 Stops a running container cleanly  /  Starts a stopped container.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "docker run -d --name name image:tag\n\ud83d\udc49 Runs a container in the background (detached mode).\n\ndocker run -p 8080:80 image:tag\n\ud83d\udc49 Runs container, mapping Host port 8080 to Container port 80.\n\ndocker run -v /host:/container image:tag\n\ud83d\udc49 Runs container, direct-mounting a host folder (bind mount).\n\ndocker run -e MY_VAR=val image:tag\n\ud83d\udc49 Injects environment variables dynamically inside container.\n\ndocker ps\n\ud83d\udc49 Lists all currently running containers.\n\ndocker ps -a\n\ud83d\udc49 Lists all containers (active, stopped, exited, crashed).\n\ndocker stop container_id   /   docker start container_id\n\ud83d\udc49 Stops a running container cleanly  /  Starts a stopped container.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
