      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "docker exec -it container_name sh (or bash)\n\ud83d\udc49 SSH / Shell directly into a running container filesystem.\n\ndocker logs -f container_name\n\ud83d\udc49 Follows container console logs/stdout output in real-time.\n\ndocker inspect container_name\n\ud83d\udc49 Returns comprehensive configuration details in JSON format.\n\ndocker stats\n\ud83d\udc49 Live streaming metrics: CPU, Memory, Network & Disk usage.\n\ndocker rm container_id\n\ud83d\udc49 Permanently deletes a stopped container.\n\ndocker system prune -a\n\ud83d\udc49 CRITICAL CLEANUP: Deletes all stopped containers, unused\n   networks, build caches, and images to free system space.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "docker exec -it container_name sh (or bash)\n\ud83d\udc49 SSH / Shell directly into a running container filesystem.\n\ndocker logs -f container_name\n\ud83d\udc49 Follows container console logs/stdout output in real-time.\n\ndocker inspect container_name\n\ud83d\udc49 Returns comprehensive configuration details in JSON format.\n\ndocker stats\n\ud83d\udc49 Live streaming metrics: CPU, Memory, Network & Disk usage.\n\ndocker rm container_id\n\ud83d\udc49 Permanently deletes a stopped container.\n\ndocker system prune -a\n\ud83d\udc49 CRITICAL CLEANUP: Deletes all stopped containers, unused\n   networks, build caches, and images to free system space.",
