      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1780139500000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "docker compose up\n\ud83d\udc49 Reads yaml file, downloads layers, starts services in foreground.\n\ndocker compose up -d\n\ud83d\udc49 Starts entire multi-container service stack in background.\n\ndocker compose down\n\ud83d\udc49 Stops, wipes, and deletes compose containers and networks.\n\ndocker compose ps\n\ud83d\udc49 Lists running compose services and their bound ports.\n\ndocker compose logs -f service_name\n\ud83d\udc49 Real-time live tails the log output for a specific service.\n\ndocker compose exec service_name sh\n\ud83d\udc49 Shell directly inside a service configured in compose yaml.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "docker compose up\n\ud83d\udc49 Reads yaml file, downloads layers, starts services in foreground.\n\ndocker compose up -d\n\ud83d\udc49 Starts entire multi-container service stack in background.\n\ndocker compose down\n\ud83d\udc49 Stops, wipes, and deletes compose containers and networks.\n\ndocker compose ps\n\ud83d\udc49 Lists running compose services and their bound ports.\n\ndocker compose logs -f service_name\n\ud83d\udc49 Real-time live tails the log output for a specific service.\n\ndocker compose exec service_name sh\n\ud83d\udc49 Shell directly inside a service configured in compose yaml.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    }
  ],
